Error [E0927]: `#Graph` is not a declared checked text block
  --> tests/ui/declared_text_block_undeclared.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     #Graph {
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: checked text blocks come from the one library rule registry
 Fix: declare `marker Graph(…)` with `@sites: [.Block]` before using `#Graph { … }`
